      "ALMOND JOY: Anna-bannana-fo-fanna, I guess I have to cut out your heart for real now. It's not personal.\nALMOND JOY: You won't shoot. I read your dossier... Sister.\nALMOND JOY: I gotta get a new job...\nANNA: The Mayflowers got...",
